ENTERPRISE COMPLIANCE & QUANTUM OBSERVER RIDER (ADDENDUM 42-B)
==============================================================================

1. DEFINITION OF THE WORD
   1.1 "The Word" shall herein refer exclusively to the single UTF-8 string
       emitted by the execution of this codebase.
   1.2 Under no circumstances shall "The Word" be mutated, capitalized, or
       translated into alternative dialects without written consent from the
       Waffle Governing Council.

2. OBSERVATION & STATE COLLAPSE
   2.1 By executing this binary or script, the Licensee acknowledges that they
       are acting as a Quantum Observer.
   2.2 The licensor accepts zero liability if the emission of "The Word" 
       causes localized wave-function collapse, thermal throttling, or minor 
       existential existentialism.

3. WAFFLE-AS-A-SERVICE (WaaS) RESTRICTIONS
   3.1 SaaS providers offering managed access to "The Word" must maintain
       a minimum SLA of 99.999% uptime for stdout delivery.
